{"text":"Their number and conviction, the only thing greater than their diversity, to demonstrate for the end to our Civil War, and to rededicate their ardent energies to the peaceful pursuit of progress, I am therefore proud to stand before you, as humbled by their resolute sacrifices to symbolize also the aspirations and expectations of Liberian women, African women, and I dare say women worldwide. I stand before you today equally proud to be the first woman president of our African continent, a continent that has embraced the process of change and transformation.","words":[{"text":"Their","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"number","start":0.68,"end":1.0},{"text":"and","start":1.0,"end":1.4},{"text":"conviction","start":1.4,"end":2.0,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":3.16,"end":3.24},{"text":"only","start":3.24,"end":3.56},{"text":"thing","start":3.56,"end":3.94},{"text":"greater","start":3.94,"end":4.24},{"text":"than","start":4.24,"end":4.56},{"text":"their","start":4.56,"end":4.76},{"text":"diversity","start":4.76,"end":5.46,"punct":","},{"text":"to","start":6.44,"end":6.74},{"text":"demonstrate","start":6.74,"end":7.36},{"text":"for","start":7.36,"end":7.62},{"text":"the","start":7.62,"end":7.8},{"text":"end","start":7.8,"end":8.04},{"text":"to","start":8.04,"end":8.26},{"text":"our","start":8.26,"end":8.34},{"text":"Civil","start":8.34,"end":8.58},{"text":"War","start":8.58,"end":9.04,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":9.98,"end":10.12},{"text":"to","start":10.12,"end":10.26},{"text":"rededicate","start":10.26,"end":11.0},{"text":"their","start":11.0,"end":11.34},{"text":"ardent","start":11.34,"end":11.76},{"text":"energies","start":11.76,"end":12.26},{"text":"to","start":12.26,"end":12.48},{"text":"the","start":12.48,"end":12.6},{"text":"peaceful","start":12.6,"end":12.94},{"text":"pursuit","start":12.94,"end":13.38},{"text":"of","start":13.38,"end":13.6},{"text":"progress","start":13.6,"end":14.08,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":15.34,"end":15.48},{"text":"